  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Esketamine is used to treat treatment-resistant depression and is also classed as a general anesthetic. It is authorised in the European Union for depressive disorder, and remains investigational for some other uses.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2365493&quot;>Wikidata Q2365493</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>esketamine</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>N01AX14, N06AX27</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB11823&quot;>DB11823</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/182137&quot;>182137</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:60799&quot;>60799</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2365493&quot;>Q2365493</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C13H16ClNO</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>237.727 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
